* AD4021 ADC Front End Simulation
.lib AD4021.sub

* Primary DC Input
V1 IN 0 1V

* Supplies and Reference
V2 VREF 0 5V
V3 VDD 0 1.8V
V4 VIO 0 1.8V

* Control Signals (1 MSPS Conversion Rate)
* CNV initiates conversion on rising edge. Held high for 350ns (conversion phase).
V5 CNV 0 PULSE(0 1.8V 0 1ns 1ns 350ns 1us)

* SCK clocks out the data during the acquisition phase (CNV low).
* 50 MHz clock, 25 pulses to ensure the 20-bit result is fully shifted out.
V6 SCK 0 PULSE(0 1.8V 400ns 1ns 1ns 10ns 20ns 25)

* SDI tied low for standard single-ADC 3-wire/4-wire configuration
V7 SDI 0 0V

* AD4021 Instantiation
* Standard ADI SAR ADC subcircuit pin order: IN+ IN- REF VDD VIO GND CNV SDI SCK SDO
X1 IN 0 VREF VDD VIO 0 CNV SDI SCK OUT AD4021

* Transient Analysis to capture one full conversion and data readout phase
.tran 0 1.5us

.end
